Subject: [PATCH] OpenGL on the DRM platform via EGL/GBM

With -p drm the OGL backend had no GL context. Add an EGL context on a
GBM surface, shown with KMS page flips on the active connector and mode.
One binary now runs both OGL and Vulkan; GFXBackend selects which.

